  "label": "dishwasher at birth",
  "description": "The phrase 'dishwasher at birth' is a pun that plays on the human concept of birth — the moment of coming into existence — and applies it to an appliance. This requires understanding that 'birth' is a biological and cultural concept reserved for living beings, and that applying it to inanimate objects is absurd and humorous. The meme relies on this conceptual incongruity for its effect.",
